Code adapted from other projects
--------------------------------

Parts of these modules are adapted from other open-source agent harnesses and
keep those projects' copyright and license (MIT, text below):

- src/harness/context/overflow.py: the context-overflow error patterns, from
  pi (packages/ai/src/utils/overflow.ts) and opencode
  (packages/ai/src/provider-error.ts).
- src/harness/replies/argument_repair.py: a Python port of opencode's
  packages/core/src/plugin/tool-input-repair.ts, without its removal of fields
  the schema doesn't name.
- src/harness/routing/retry_policy.py: reading a server's retry delay from
  headers, and walking an error's causes, from OpenHands software-agent-sdk
  (openhands/sdk/llm/utils/retry_after.py, openhands/sdk/llm/exceptions/classifier.py).
- src/harness/replies/cut_reply.py: the wording of the note on a tool call cut
  off at the output limit, from pi (packages/agent/src/agent-loop.ts).

