Ideas from other projects
-------------------------

Other parts follow ideas first seen in these projects, written here from
scratch with none of their code: OpenAI Codex (Apache-2.0), Gemini CLI
(Apache-2.0), goose (Apache-2.0), OpenHands software-agent-sdk (MIT), opencode
(MIT), Hermes Agent (MIT), pi (MIT) and DeepSeek Harness (MIT). Each module
that took an idea names its source in its docstring.

